---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Gallery from '../../components/Gallery.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Reflow Oven Controller"
  description="In this project, we designed a controller that managed the temperature of a toaster oven through the reflow process to solder components onto PCBs."
  image="/images/board-1.jpg"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Reflow Oven Controller</h1>
    </header>
    <article class="project">
      <Gallery variant="single" images={[{ src: '/images/board-1.jpg', alt: 'Reflow oven controller board' }]} />
      <p>
        In this project, we designed a controller that managed the temperature of a toaster oven through the reflow process to solder components onto PCBs.
      </p>
      <Gallery
        variant="pair"
        images={[
          { src: '/images/reflow_states-2.png', alt: 'Reflow oven state diagram' },
          { src: '/images/reflow_plot-1.png', alt: 'Reflow temperature plot' },
        ]}
      />
      <p>
        These plots represent our goals compared to the outcomes. After the initial ramp up to 150°C, the oven preheats the PCB for a period of time before ramping up to reflow temperatures of 220°C.
      </p>
      <Gallery variant="single" images={[{ src: '/images/microcontroller-4.jpg', alt: 'Microcontroller' }]} />
      <p>The result was a successfully soldered PCB that was used in the Coin Picking Robot project.</p>
      <p class="align-end">
        View our GitHub <a href="https://github.com/Abeilles14/Project-1-Reflow-Oven-Controller" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">page</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
